From bec61d17bad6e2d46dcc7906c37f988487db1aac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeandre Coetzer <j.coetzer@paradigmengineers.com.au>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:27:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(btc-toolchanger): add panel for BTC hotend toolchangers

Adds a dashboard panel for hotend-swapping toolchangers that run the
BTC (Bikin Toolchanger) macros, e.g. Lineux Hotswap. It shows each
hotend with its filament colour, temperature and fan speed, and opens
a tool dialog to select the tool, set its temperature, edit offsets
and assign a Spoolman spool (reusing SpoolmanChangeSpoolDialog).

The panel only appears when the btc_dashboard Klipper add-on is loaded
(printer.btc_dashboard), the same way the MMU panel depends on
printer.mmu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
